{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1cd287e-ecdc-84b9-81a8-db730e2ed881",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T14:19:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:15:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hi, um, well, I'm calling about a drain. A catch basin, I guess you call it, on my street. It's blocked and the water just sits there. Again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:15:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. What's the address or the nearest address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:15:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 186 Mill Street, up in the Historic Hill part. The basin is right at the end of the lane, kind of across from my place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "186 Mill Street. And what's going on with it, is it backed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, um, there's a snowbank sitting right on top of it. From the plowing, weeks ago now. It's got hard as a rock. So the melt from the sun can't get down the drain, and it pools all the way across the lane. And it's not even raining, there's no storm, it's been dry all week. It's just this slow runoff and nowhere for it to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the snowbank is covering the basin and the meltwater is collecting across the lane. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And it's, um, it's starting to run toward my neighbor's garage. The one next door, the gray one. It's moving right along the edge of the driveway and if it freezes tonight, that's ice, and if it doesn't, it's in his garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Toward the neighbor's garage, on the downhill side. Is there water inside the garage yet, or is it just heading that way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just heading that way so far. About a foot from the door, maybe less. I went out and looked before I called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know. I'll mark it as water approaching a structure so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Well, and I want to know when they last came by. Because somebody is supposed to clear those, aren't they? I haven't seen a truck on this street in, oh, I don't know, a month at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:17:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the history for that location. [pause] I'm seeing the street on the list for plowing, but I don't see a drain cleaning logged for that basin recently. I'll note that you asked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing recent. Well, that figures. So it's been sitting like this and nobody's even looked at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:18:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what the record shows, yes. I'll send this over to the crew supervisor so someone can clear the snow off the basin and see if it's open underneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Um, I'd just like it done today if it can be. The neighbor's not home, he's at work till late, and I don't want to be the one standing out there with a shovel at nine at night. Plus his dog barks at the mail carrier every morning, so I'm sure he's not in a forgiving mood about anything, ha."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:18:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll leave the dog out of the notes. Do you want a call back when the crew's been out? I can put your number on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-oh. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daniela Valdez. V-A-L-D-E-Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:19:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Valdez. So that's 186 Mill Street, snowbank over the catch basin, water across the lane heading for the neighbor's garage, no recent cleaning on record. I'll flag it for this afternoon, and you'll get a call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope somebody actually comes this time. It keeps being the same thing every winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I've got it written up with the details, so it won't get lost. If the water reaches the garage before they arrive, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T14:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye-bye, take care."
    }
  ],
